{"context":{"after":[],"before":[{"id":"seg-000159-0d49a8996984","source":"strengths of humans and AI. We bring"},{"id":"seg-000160-a6d0131504dd","source":"critical thinking, judgment, creativity,"}]},"items":[{"id":"seg-000161-e7960f5ade51","source":"and ethical oversight that AI may"},{"id":"seg-000162-b88c1935485c","source":"struggle to replicate. While AI offers"},{"id":"seg-000163-31ab3257cc0c","source":"speed, scale, pattern recognition, and"},{"id":"seg-000164-0de3f6d6e626","source":"the ability to process vast amounts of"},{"id":"seg-000165-d002578a240e","source":"information. These complimentary"},{"id":"seg-000166-8cdc8c518888","source":"strengths will evolve as the technology"},{"id":"seg-000167-5b2700ad4be3","source":"evolves. That's why continued learning"},{"id":"seg-000168-2f3a6db52a7f","source":"and experimentation are so valuable."},{"id":"seg-000169-58a24b3ad181","source":"They help you stay a breast of these"},{"id":"seg-000170-f239227ba568","source":"changes and discover new possibilities."},{"id":"seg-000171-64adbc940421","source":"In these exercises across this course,"},{"id":"seg-000172-867c221f5a94","source":"you'll have a chance to explore these"},{"id":"seg-000173-97036401b56c","source":"concepts firsthand through conversations"},{"id":"seg-000174-ed79d7d78aad","source":"with Claude. This direct experience will"},{"id":"seg-000175-e9fe129ebbe7","source":"help you develop an intuitive feel for"},{"id":"seg-000176-85bfc380aac6","source":"what generative AI can do, can't do, and"},{"id":"seg-000177-5afa119394e2","source":"how best to work with it."}],"output_fields":["id","translation"],"source_language":"en-orig","target_language":"zh-CN","translation_contract_version":4}
